  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Updated DotExtensions from 9.2.0 Preview 2 to 9.3.0\n* Updated DotExtensions.Memory from 9.2.0 Preview 2 to 9.3.0\n* Updated DotPrimitives from 4.0.0 to 4.1.0\n* Updated internal Polyfill version from 9.3.1 to 9.4.1\n* Reworked Span<T> and ReadOnlySpan<T> ``Index`` method to mirror LINQ's Index method\n* Added Memory<T> and ReadOnlyMemory<T> deferred execution mode ``Index`` method\n* Added Memory<T> and ReadOnlyMemory<T> ``AsEnumerable`` deferred enumeration method\n* Added Span<T> and ReadOnlySpan<T> immediate mode ``OrderBy(Func<TSource, TKey>)`` and ``OrderBy(Func<TSource, TKey>, IComparer<TKey>?)`` \n* Added Memory<T> and ReadOnlyMemory<T> deferred execution mode ``OrderBy(Func<TSource, TKey>)`` and ``OrderBy(Func<TSource, TKey>, IComparer<TKey>?)`` \n* Replaced Memory<T> and ReadOnlyMemory<T> immediate mode ``Select`` method with deferred execution ``Select`` method\n* Added ReadOnlySpan<T> immediate mode ``IndicesOf(T)`` and ``IndicesOf(Func<T, bool>)`` methods\n* Added ReadOnlyMemory<T> immediate mode ``LastIndex`` method\n* Added Memory<T> and ReadOnlyMemory<T> ``CountAtLeast(int)`` and ``CountAtLeast(Func<T, bool>, int)`` methods\n* Added Memory<T> and ReadOnlyMemory<T> ``CountAtMost(int)`` and ``CountAtMost(Func<T, bool>, int)`` methods\n* Converted ``LastIndex`` extension block methods to extension block properties\n* Improved Span<T>, ReadOnlySpan<T>, Memory<T>, and ReadOnlyMemory<T> ``Last`` and ``LastOrDefault`` method performance through avoiding Span and Memory reversal\n* Fixed a bug where ElementAt and ElementsAt methods would throw an exception if index was 0.",
